        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 5.03 In the event that employees are not able to return and be ready to resume their duties by 1:00 PM, they shall work the necessary time after 5:00 PM required to complete four hours' actual working time (including their return to headquarters) at the straight time rate of pay.",
