        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 5.04 By mutual consent of the Employer and the Local Union, and if the majority of the crew members involved so desire, they can elect to carry lunch and limit their lunch period to thirty minutes; and in such event, the crews shall be returned to headquarters by 4:30 PM.",
